"Synchronize times with screen refresh (good for visual stimuli and responses"
" based on them)"
msgstr "将时间与屏幕刷新同步（适用于视觉刺激及对视觉刺激的应答）"

#: psychopy/psychopy/experiment/components/_base.py:131
msgid "Sync timing with screen refresh"
msgstr "计时与屏幕刷新同步"

