msgstr "请问定义颜色的格式（色彩空间）为？（rgb, dkl, lms, hsv）"

#: psychopy/psychopy/experiment/components/_base.py:1581
msgid "Fill color of this stimulus (e.g. $[1,1,0], red )"
msgstr "此刺激的填充色（例：$[1,1,0]，红色）"

#: psychopy/psychopy/experiment/components/_base.py:1597
msgid ""
"Opacity of the stimulus (1=opaque, 0=fully transparent, 0.5=translucent). "
"Leave blank for each color to have its own opacity (recommended if any color"
" is None)."
msgstr "此刺激的透明度（1=不透明，=-完全透明，0.5=半透明）。如每种颜色有单独的透明度，请留空（若任一颜色为None，建议留空）。"

#: psychopy/psychopy/experiment/components/_base.py:1606
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Contrast of the stimulus (1.0=unchanged contrast, 0.5=decrease contrast, "
"0.0=uniform/no contrast, -0.5=slightly inverted, -1.0=totally inverted)"
msgstr "此刺激的对比度（1.0=原对比度，0.5=降低对比度，0.0=无对比度，-0.5=轻度反色，-1.0=完全反色）"

#: psychopy/psychopy/experiment/components/_base.py:1616
msgid "Position of this stimulus (e.g. [1,2] )"
msgstr "此刺激的位置（例：[1,2]）"

#: psychopy/psychopy/experiment/components/_base.py:1624
msgid ""
"Size of this stimulus (either a single value or x,y pair, e.g. 2.5, [1,2] "
msgstr "此刺激的大小（单一值或[x,y]数对，例：2.5，[1,2]） "

#: psychopy/psychopy/experiment/components/_base.py:1637
msgid "Orientation of this stimulus (in deg)"
msgstr "此刺激的旋转方向（单位为“度”）"

